{"t":"GE","made":"2026-11-11 00:34","name":"GE Aerospace","ko":"GE에어로스페이스","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","employees":57000,"hq":"Evendale, OH, United States","website":"https://www.geaerospace.com","summary_en":"General Electric Company, doing business as GE Aerospace, designs and produces commercial and defense aircraft engines, integrated engine components, electric power, and aircraft systems. The company operates through two segments, Commercial Engines & Services, and Defense & Propulsion Technologies. The Commercial Engines & Services segment designs, develops, manufactures, maintenance, repair, and overhaul (MRO) services of jet engines and sale of spare parts for commercial airframes, business aviation, and aeroderivative applications. The Defense & Propulsion Technologies designs, develops, manufactures, and services jet engines and avionics and power systems for governments, militaries, and commercial airframers, as well as MRO of engines and the sale of spare parts. This segment also offers aircraft components and systems, such as small turboprop engines, aeroengine mechanical transmissions, turbines, combustors and controls, additive manufacturing, propeller systems, ignition systems, sensors and engine accessories for fixed wing and rotorcraft applications for commercial and military end users under the Avio Aero, Unison, Dowty Propellers, and Colibrium Additive brands. The company operates in the United States, Europe, Asia, the Americas, the Middle East, and Africa. General Electric Company was incorporated in 1892 and is based in Evendale, Ohio.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"GE Aerospace라는 이름으로 사업을 운영하는 General Electric Company는 상업용 및 국방용 항공기 엔진, 통합 엔진 부품, 전력 및 항공기 시스템을 설계 및 생산합니다. 이 회사는 상업용 엔진 및 서비스와 방위 및 추진 기술이라는 두 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 상업용 엔진 및 서비스 부문은 제트 엔진의 MRO(유지보수, 수리 및 분해 검사) 서비스를 설계, 개발, 제조하고 상업용 기체, 비즈니스 항공 및 항공기 파생 응용 분야용 예비 부품 판매를 담당합니다. Defense & Propulsion Technologies는 정부, 군대, 상업용 기체를 위한 제트 엔진과 항공전자공학 및 전력 시스템을 설계, 개발, 제조 및 서비스할 뿐만 아니라 엔진 MRO 및 예비 부품 판매도 제공합니다. 이 부문은 또한 Avio Aero, Unison, Dowty Propellers 및 Colibrium Additive 브랜드로 상업 및 군용 최종 사용자를 위한 소형 터보프롭 엔진, 항공기 엔진 기계식 변속기, 터빈, 연소기 및 제어 장치, 적층 제조, 프로펠러 시스템, 점화 시스템, 고정 날개 및 회전익 항공기 응용 분야용 센서 및 엔진 부속품과 같은 항공기 부품 및 시스템을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 미국, 유럽, 아시아, 미주, 중동 및 아프리카에서 운영됩니다. General Electric Company는 1892년에 설립되었으며 오하이오주 Evendale에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":332.98,"mcap":345487572992.0,"pe":38.05486,"fpe":35.75513,"peg":3.7861,"ps":6.5712028,"pb":19.637888,"ev_ebitda":30.798,"div":0.56,"beta":1.409,"hi52":388.84,"lo52":268.91},"fin":{"rev":52576002048.0,"rev_g":0.159,"eps_g":0.089,"gross":0.30065,"op":0.18494,"net":0.17313999,"roe":0.50165004,"fcf":6332375040.0,"cash":9802000384.0,"debt":20587999232.0,"de":115.989,"eps":8.75,"feps":9.31279},"own":{"short":0.0111,"inst":0.81387,"insider":0.00301},"analyst":{"n":21,"mean":378.42856,"median":380.0,"high":431.0,"low":280.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.52174,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":16,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":16,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":15,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":16,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":380.0,"priorPriceTarget":377.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"BNP Paribas","ToGrade":"Underperform","FromGrade":"Underperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":280.0,"priorPriceTarget":305.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":375.0,"priorPriceTarget":400.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Susquehanna","ToGrade":"Positive","FromGrade":"Positive","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","